    {
      "text": "we have forsaken all, and followed thee, Matt. 19:27. every one that hath forsaken houses, Matt. 19:29. disciples forsook him, Matt. 26:56 (Mark 14:50). my God, why hast thou forsaken me, Matt. 27:46 (Ps. 22:1; Mark 15:34). forsook their nets, and followed him, Mark 1:18 (Luke 5:11). forsaketh not all that he hath, he cannot be my disciple, Luke 14:33. Demas hath forsaken me, 2 Tim. 4:10. By faith he forsook Egypt, not fearing the wrath, Heb. 11:27. I will never leave thee, nor forsake thee, Heb. 13:5. Which have forsaken the right way, 2 Pet. 2:15.",
